#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/accesscontrol/overview.js:436
msgid "For this rule, holiday mode and weekday selection are mutually exclusive. Chinese working days replace the selected weekdays: ordinary weekends and holidays are unrestricted; make-up working days are restricted. This rule's times and MAC address still apply. Weekday edits are saved even when holiday mode hides them; turning holiday mode off restores these selections."
msgstr "本规则的“按节假日”模式与星期选择互斥，按中国实际工作日替代已勾选的星期：普通周末和节假日放行，调休补班日限制。仍使用本规则的时间段和 MAC 地址。本次星期编辑即使因开启“按节假日”而隐藏，也会保存；取消后恢复这些选择。"

