#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/accesscontrol/overview.js:84
msgid "Holiday calendar ready."
msgstr "节假日日历已就绪。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/accesscontrol/overview.js:90
msgid "Holiday calendar rules could not be applied. Previous rules are retained while retrying."
msgstr "日历规则应用失败，原规则保留，正在重试。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/accesscontrol/overview.js:93
msgid "Holiday calendar status could not be read."
msgstr "无法读取节假日日历状态。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/accesscontrol/overview.js:93
msgid "Holiday calendar status could not be read. Refresh the page or log in again."
msgstr "无法读取节假日日历状态。请刷新页面或重新登录。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/accesscontrol/overview.js:81
msgid "Holiday calendar status is not available yet. Save & Apply to start the holiday service; if it stays empty, check the system log."
msgstr "节假日日历状态尚未生成。请先“保存并应用”启动节假日服务；若仍为空，请查看系统日志。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/accesscontrol/overview.js:87
msgid "Holiday calendar unavailable. Using the rules' selected weekdays until calendar data is ready."
msgstr "节假日数据未就绪，暂时沿用各规则原有的星期选择，待日历数据就绪后自动切换。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/accesscontrol/overview.js:437
msgid "Holiday mode dates each part of a period by the day it belongs to: a part crossing midnight follows its end date, and a part from 18:00 on follows the next day, so the night before a holiday stays open and the last holiday night is restricted. A period that reaches 18:00 is split at that boundary. For example 20:10–08:00 and 21:30–22:00 are both unrestricted on an ordinary Friday night and restricted on the last holiday night, while 17:00–18:30 keeps 17:00–18:00 on the current day and follows the next day from 18:00."
msgstr "在“按节假日”模式下，时段按各段所属的日期判定：跨午夜的部分按结束日期，18:00 起的部分按次日，因此假日前一晚放行、假期最后一晚限制；跨越 18:00 的时段会在该分界处自动拆开。例如 20:10–08:00 和 21:30–22:00 在普通周五晚都放行、在假期最后一晚都限制，而 17:00–18:30 的 17:00–18:00 按当天、18:00 之后按次日。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/accesscontrol/overview.js:438
msgid "Holiday mode follows the router's own timezone from System → Timezone for both the period times and the holiday dates, so a China holiday calendar needs the router set to a UTC+8 zone."
msgstr "在“按节假日”模式下，时段时间和节假日日期都按路由器自身时区判定（“系统 → 时区”）；要与中国节假历一致，请把路由器时区设为东八区。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/accesscontrol/overview.js:439
msgid "Holiday mode includes the entire end minute: an end time of 06:00 remains restricted through 06:00:59 and releases at 06:01. Equal start and end times restrict only that minute."
msgstr "“按节假日”模式包含结束时间所在的整分钟：结束时间为 06:00 时，限制持续到 06:00:59，06:01 解除。开始和结束时间相同时，仅限制该分钟。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/accesscontrol/overview.js:440
msgid "If calendar data is unavailable, this rule uses its selected weekdays. If calendar rules cannot be applied, the previous rules remain in place while the service retries."
msgstr "日历数据未就绪时，本规则沿用已勾选的星期；日历规则应用失败时，保留原规则并自动重试。"

